&lt;p&gt;The 2026 IEEE/CCAE Symposium on Advanced Electrification Systems (SAES2026) brings together researchers, industry practitioners, and policymakers to discuss advances in electrification with a special focus on Energy Storage Systems in 2026. The symposium emphasizes system-level integration, modeling, control, safety, and sustainability across transportation, power grids, and digital infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
